- Implemented core functionality in `index.ts` to handle GitHub issue and pull request comments.
- Created `package.json` to manage dependencies and project metadata.
- Added scripts for version release and tag management in `publish` and `release`.
- Introduced TypeScript configuration in `tsconfig.json` for improved type safety and modern JavaScript features.
- Generated environment type definitions in `sst-env.d.ts` for SST compatibility.

